    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, but the \"sequential\" thing still feels like it's just a way to avoid picking a real priority. if we had to choose just one to be the main driver of equity, wouldn't focusing on the lowest income earners be the most just approach? it seems like any other way just dilutes the actual goal of helping those most in need.",
